  "body": {
    "id": "prop:efficient-exact-hit-cr-face",
    "kind": "proposition",
    "statement": "Under \\(\\mathsf{CR}(\\alpha)\\), if \\(\\alpha_k>0\\) only for every \\(k\\in A\\), then \\[\\sqrt C\\{\\widetilde U_{C,A}-U_A(P_0)\\}\\Rightarrow N(0,\\Sigma_{CR,A}),\\qquad \\widehat\\Sigma_{C,A}\\to_P\\Sigma_{CR,A}.\\] No estimator or covariance limit is asserted for an unallocated inactive policy.",
    "free_symbols": [
      "\\mathsf{CR}(\\alpha)",
      "\\alpha",
      "A",
      "C",
      "\\widetilde U_{C,A}",
      "U_k",
      "P_0",
      "\\Sigma_{CR,A}",
      "\\widehat\\Sigma_{C,A}"
    ],
    "depends_on": [
      "ass:iid-schedules",
      "ass:isolated-clusters",
      "ass:cr-label-vector",
      "ass:cr-label-schedule-independence",
      "ass:cr-shares",
      "ass:cr-exact-slices",
      "ass:nondegenerate-active-slices",
      "def:observed-law-kernels",
      "def:exact-slice-welfare",
      "def:calibrated-estimator",
      "thm:nuisance-deletion-cr"
    ],
    "proof_tex": "Condition on the fixed-count label vector and restrict attention to \\(k\\in A\\).  For each such \\(k\\), \\(C_{C,k}/C\\to\\alpha_k>0\\), so every active cell count diverges and direct ratio expansion gives\n\\[\n \\sqrt C(\\widetilde U_{C,k}-U_k)\n =\\frac1{\\sqrt C}\\sum_{c=1}^C\\frac{C}{C_{C,k}}\\mathbf1\\{L_c=k\\}\n \\{W_c(Z_c)-\\mu_{Z_c}\\}+o_P(1). \\tag{20}\n\\]\nThe active summands are centered and bounded, their cross-products vanish across distinct strata, and their conditional covariance converges to\n\\[\n \\operatorname{diag}(\\tau_k^2/\\alpha_k:k\\in A)=\\Sigma_{CR,A}. \\tag{21}\n\\]\nThe maximum normalized increment is \\(O(C^{-1/2})\\), so the conditional characteristic-function expansion proves the active Gaussian limit.  Replacing \\(\\mu_z\\) by active cell means and applying the bounded conditional law of large numbers proves \\(\\widehat\\Sigma_{C,A}\\to_P\\Sigma_{CR,A}\\).  The nondegeneracy assumption makes (21) positive definite.  No expression in (20)--(21) involves an inactive stratum, so no result is claimed there.",
    "justification": "The mechanism game needs only the positively allocated active tie face.",
    "gap": "The full-menu CR limit is undefined at inactive zero-share coordinates; this proposition isolates the valid face experiment.",
    "consumer": "It supplies the active covariance used by LAN, mechanism comparison, and oracle transfer.",
